  "ai_summary": "While IT consultancy stocks face collapsing 30-day (-14.92%) and 1-year (-26.54%) drops as markets price in AI automation for outsourced labor, the broader labor market tells a different story. Software developer job postings show strong 1-year (+22.91%) and positive 30-day (+2.88%) growth. Big Tech headcount is essentially flat (-1.01% YoY), reflecting normal dynamics rather than mass AI layoffs, and AI lab hiring remains stable. Devs aren't cooked yet. With software job postings showing strong annual growth, reports of the developer's death have been greatly exaggerated by people who don't know how to close a Vim window.",
